1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,967
Tuesday. 6:40 PM. Line Nine, car six,
packed to the doors.

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:07,667
Two more stops. Then dinner with Mia.
Then bed.

3
00:00:08,367 --> 00:00:12,033
The lights blink once. The train
screams to a stop in the tunnel.

4
00:00:12,733 --> 00:00:14,567
No signal. No bars. Nothing.

5
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:18,900
My last text to Mia. Six-forty train.
See you at seven.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,800
It's not just the train. The whole
city just lost power.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,467
This is your operator. Stay calm. I
have a card with fifteen rules. We
follow them.

8
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:34,567
Fourteen rules get you through the
dark. Rule fifteen is for the moment
the lights come back.

9
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:40,500
That moment is when people get hurt.
I'll tell you rule fifteen at the very
end. Don't skip.

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:47,267
Last month I survived seven nights at
a truck stop. So I moved to the city.
For something normal.

11
00:00:47,967 --> 00:00:52,300
Phones go dark. Fans stop. Four
hundred people go quiet at the same
time.

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,567
Fifteen rules? Forget it. I'm opening
these doors.
